    "description": "<p>You take a bet fit for a devil. At the cost of enhancing your weapons lethality and accuracy you throw caution to the wind.</p>\n<p>Until the beginning of your next turn, the first weapon or Taijutsu attack made as a result of a Bukijutsu you cast, is at advantage and you increase your weapons damage die by 1.</p>\n<p>But in exchange for this bet, all creatures first attack made targeting you is at advantage.</p>",
